XGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-fJPJP7iOd1ukDNqTSINIg","review_id":"lQjjqkdKEalPkZe9vqqepA","date":"2016-03-28T17:54:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9298372268676758,"text_excerpt":"Oh yeah, this is exactly what you want in a neighborhood breakfast joint. The food is great, the service is friendly, and the room is really cool. Crawfish eggs Benedict (\"eggs Ponchartrain \") were outstanding. I'd go back just for that. You'd never find this place if you don't go looking for it. Because it is tucked away in a residential neighborhood."},{"business_id":"-fJPJP7iOd1ukDNqTSINIg","review_id":"fC9dZMQbLYfeiUQefAJ6hA","date":"2011-03-28T02:39:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9270534515380859,"text_excerpt":"Riccobono serves standard New Orleans breakfast fare with charm. The service is always pretty good, and the food is tasty and hits the spot. It's tucked away in a cute Uptown neighborhood (on Panola Street, appropriately named, no?). Parking is sometimes an issue, but the line out the door proves it's worth finding a spot and walking a few blocks. If you go alone (which I did today, and it was not at all awkward or uncomfortable), you can sit at the bar and read a Where Y'at or something. This is just one of those places that really makes you feel at home. Personally, I love their silver dollar pancakes, buttery and doused in syrup. I ordered the pancakes and one fluffy scrambled egg a la..."},{"business_id":"-fJPJP7iOd1ukDNqTSINIg","review_id":"U0kDSqE9spIABguT_aflWQ","date":"2015-06-07T15:24:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9264634251594543,"text_excerpt":"By far my favorite breakfast place. I get the same thing every time because it's just too good.. 2 eggs, sausage patties and the home fries (BEST I've ever had). I'm obsessed with this place. Friendly staff, fun environment.. There's usually a bit of a wait on weekends but it's so worth it. My only complaint is I wish they were open ALL DAY!! I would come here for breakfast, lunch, and dinn.."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-fJPJP7iOd1ukDNqTSINIg","photo_id":"LNQAye_6sI2D3oYV8TaZ5Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/LNQAye_6sI2D3oYV8TaZ5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9398231506347656},{"business_id":"-fJPJP7iOd1ukDNqTSINIg","photo_id":"c2UCOtGbIcIXXaAlRGV9eg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/c2UCOtGbIcIXXaAlRGV9eg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9228266477584839},{"business_id":"-fJPJP7iOd1ukDNqTSINIg","photo_id":"WQkbfj0Co_d8RdJmp_x6DA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WQkbfj0Co_d8RdJmp_x6DA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8785157203674316}]},"notebook_case":null}
